{"id": "sf-invalid-engineering-credentials-five-projects", "title": "Two permit consultants, five notices and an invalid engineering stamp", "seconds": 87.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.054, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "e48fb44b3bd3b291", "words": 228, "beats": [{"scene": "state", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "California accepted the surrender of a civil engineer’s license in 2010.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.21, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Which", "file", "appears", "twice?"], "sub": "Engineering credentials in San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.67, 1.16, 1.28, 1.75, 1.86, 1.95, 2.27, 2.71, 3.14, 3.32, 3.67]}, {"scene": "state", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An attached accusation described a 2002 plan naming Kung-Yuen Chiu and Associates.", "t0": 4.33, "t1": 9.66, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "California Board for Professional Engineers and Land Surveyors", "text": "State disciplinary order 885-A", "mark": "State disciplinary order 885-A"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.56, 1.2, 1.64, 1.71, 1.88, 2.24, 2.48, 3.17, 3.56, 4.07, 4.44, 4.59]}, {"scene": "state", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "That earlier relationship leaves open who stamped the later plans.", "t0": 9.78, "t1": 12.96, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "2002 plan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.55, 1.15, 1.46, 1.77, 1.94, 2.28, 2.39, 2.64]}, {"scene": "notices", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In November 2024 inspectors recorded an invalid engineering stamp and a fraudulent affidavit.", "t0": 13.18, "t1": 20.03, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "n086", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "November 2024 notice", "mark": "November 2024 notice"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.59, 0.85, 1.94, 2.65, 3.17, 3.33, 3.94, 4.5, 5.16, 5.4, 5.5, 6.16]}, {"scene": "notices", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The special-inspection affidavit finding belongs to this particular complaint.", "t0": 20.15, "t1": 24.08, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "202431086", "label": "Complaint with the special-inspection affidavit finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.96, 1.48, 1.98, 2.45, 2.57, 2.77, 3.34]}, {"scene": "notices", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In March 2025 the director placed Kung Yuen Chiu and CD Design under additional oversight.", "t0": 24.2, "t1": 30.24, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "chiu", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "March 18 determination", "mark": "March 18 determination"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.49, 0.78, 1.83, 2.0, 2.39, 2.73, 3.01, 3.3, 3.63, 3.79, 4.13, 4.57, 4.78, 5.21]}, {"scene": "notices", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In April the director placed Victor Ngoon under the same program.", "t0": 30.36, "t1": 33.58, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ngoon", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "April 3 determination", "mark": "April 3 determination"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.54, 0.64, 1.02, 1.38, 1.7, 2.16, 2.38, 2.48, 2.71]}, {"scene": "notices", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Each order cited three notices. One complaint appeared in both lists.", "t0": 33.7, "t1": 38.39, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Two signed determinations", "heading": "A complaint shared by both orders", "source": "chiu", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "March list", "value": "202430934"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "April list", "value": "202430934"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.63, 0.98, 1.25, 2.4, 2.66, 3.14, 3.53, 3.66, 3.95]}, {"scene": "notices", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The five distinct notices identified six permit applications.", "t0": 38.51, "t1": 41.72, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Five notices, six applications"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.45, 0.83, 1.3, 1.84, 2.14, 2.46]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The affidavit case still showed a suspended permit in June 2025.", "t0": 41.94, "t1": 46.09, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "h086", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "Hearing and abatement log", "mark": "Hearing and abatement log"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.74, 1.01, 1.29, 1.56, 1.64, 2.13, 2.46, 2.6, 2.87, 3.15]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A new engineer was hired. A corrective permit reached completion that September.", "t0": 46.21, "t1": 50.44, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "DBI corrective permit", "heading": "A new engineer and a replacement permit", "source": "replacement", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "Permit issued", "value": "August 6"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Work completed", "value": "September 16"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.28, 0.66, 0.81, 1.56, 1.72, 2.15, 2.5, 2.74, 3.26, 3.43]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The inspector closed the site case with no fees.", "t0": 50.56, "t1": 53.1, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "h086", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "September 19 entry", "mark": "September 19 entry"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.6, 0.96, 1.08, 1.37, 1.67, 1.84, 2.03]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "By March 2026, records showed four site cases abated.", "t0": 53.22, "t1": 56.99, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "h933", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "March 25 abatement", "mark": "March 25 abatement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.42, 0.71, 1.68, 2.03, 2.34, 2.62, 2.9, 3.31]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The fifth remained active in the public data.", "t0": 57.11, "t1": 59.44, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "n093", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "Fifth notice", "mark": "Fifth notice"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.48, 0.84, 1.31, 1.48, 1.59, 1.94]}, {"scene": "contacts", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "A wider search matched the surrendered number on 17 applications across 14 parcels.", "t0": 59.66, "t1": 64.51, "shot": "extra-contacts", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Permit contacts after the surrender", "heading": "One number across multiple applications", "source": "contacts17", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Applications", "value": "17"}, {"icon": "building", "label": "Parcels", "value": "14"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.49, 0.85, 1.21, 1.34, 1.8, 2.17, 2.37, 2.87, 3.54, 3.87, 4.3]}, {"scene": "contacts", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "Eleven applications concerned nine other parcels. The records include unissued work.", "t0": 64.63, "t1": 69.42, "shot": "outside-sites", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "11", "label": "Other applications to verify"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 1.03, 1.48, 1.73, 1.94, 2.81, 2.99, 3.37, 3.75, 4.2]}, {"scene": "contacts", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "Two applications were issued together in August 2026. Both also listed a second engineer.", "t0": 69.54, "t1": 75.25, "shot": "two-permits", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "august", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "Both engineering contacts", "mark": "Both engineering contacts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.8, 0.95, 1.24, 1.61, 1.74, 2.07, 2.35, 3.62, 3.93, 4.28, 4.73, 4.88, 5.25]}, {"scene": "contacts", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "That engineer’s separate license was active. The signed plans would show who took responsibility.", "t0": 75.37, "t1": 80.84, "shot": "two-licenses", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "enginReg", "kicker": "California Department of Consumer Affairs", "text": "State engineering register", "mark": "State engineering register"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.7, 1.03, 1.39, 1.56, 2.84, 3.02, 3.37, 3.79, 3.98, 4.25, 4.43, 4.64]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The records leave the affidavit’s author and replacement costs unresolved.", "t0": 81.06, "t1": 84.6, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Who made the affidavit?", "Replacement costs"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.52, 0.7, 0.82, 1.41, 1.73, 1.84, 2.33, 2.79]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 84.72, "t1": 86.97, "shot": "r15", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.69, 0.89, 1.2, 1.31, 1.41, 1.67, 1.91]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"state": "An earlier connection in the state file", "notices": "Five files behind two orders", "followup": "What changed at the properties", "contacts": "Check the design contacts"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "question"}